      <div class="bg-[#353439] border border-[#555] rounded-lg p-8 my-8">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-2xl text-[#F7F7F7] mb-6 text-center">FriendZone Essential Mix</h3>
        <p class="text-[#F7F7F7] text-center mb-6">
          I recently had the honor of recording an Essential Mix for my friend Jerry and his FriendZone podcast series. The Essential Mix is a legendary mix series by Pete Tong where an artist gets 2 hours to play a set of their essential songs. I spent a lot of time carefully curating my setlist to include all the songs that my friends and I loved over the years. This was also my first experience using Ableton to create a continuous mix. Huge thanks to Tony and Jerry for the amazing intro!
        </p>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="border border-[#555] rounded-lg p-6 bg-[#26262a]">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg text-[#F7F7F7] mb-2">FRNDZN026 - E.Heyl presents TSFG</h4>
            <p class="text-[#cccccc] text-sm mb-4">Essential Mix • FriendZone Podcast</p>
